  answer: Disney Studio Chorus
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Disney Studio Chorus
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABMain Title (Once Upon a Dream)\xBB, de
    1959, y llega hasta 2009."
  - "\xABBella Notte - From \"Lady and the Tramp\" / Soundtrack Version\xBB presenta
    una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a 88 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABWhen You Wish Upon a Star - From \"Pinocchio\"/Soundtrack
    Version\xBB y \xABYo, Ho! (A Pirate's Life For Me) - From \"Pirates of the Caribbean\"\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABWinnie the Pooh - From \"Winnie the Pooh and the Honey
    Tree\"\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABWhen You Wish Upon a Star\xBB y \xABFeed
    The Birds (Tuppence A Bag) - From \"Mary Poppins\"/Soundtrack Version\xBB."
